 # API

-JSON in, JSON out. Routes are listed in `README.md`.
+JSON in, JSON out. Routes are listed in `README.md` (including `GET /audit`).
+
+## Authentication and roles
+
+Every request carries `Authorization: Bearer <key>`, matched against `apiKeys`
+in the store:
+
+- `viewer`: may only read (`GET`, except `GET /audit`).
+- `cook`: may also cook recipes (`POST /recipes/:id/cook`), record waste
+  (`POST /batches/:id/waste`), log temperatures (`POST /temperatures`) and
+  enter stock-take counts (`POST /stocktakes/:id/counts`).
+- `manager`: may do everything, including `GET /audit`.
+
+A missing or unknown key answers `401` (`unauthorized`); a valid key without
+permission answers `403` (`forbidden`). Every request that changes data writes
+an audit entry, returned newest first by `GET /audit`.

